   122→      controls valid transitions.
   123→    acceptance_criteria:
   124→      - id: ac-state-1
   125→        given: a task in pending state
   126→        when: kspec task start is run
   127→        then: task transitions to in_progress
   128→      - id: ac-state-2
   129→        given: a task with depends_on another pending task
   130→        when: ready tasks are queried
   131→        then: the dependent task is NOT in the ready list
   132→      - id: ac-state-3
   133→        given: a task blocked by dependencies
   134→        when: all dependencies complete
   135→        then: task becomes ready (unblocked)
