   280→            given: TaskStatusSchema in common.ts
   281→            when: validating a task status value
   282→            then: pending_review is accepted as a valid enum value
   283→          - id: ac-2
   284→            given: a task with status pending_review
   285→            when: kspec task complete is run
   286→            then: the task transitions to completed (pending_review is a valid pre-state for completion)
   287→          - id: ac-4
   288→            given: a task with status pending_review
   289→            when: ready tasks are queried via kspec tasks ready
   290→            then: the pending_review task is NOT included (only pending tasks are ready)
   291→          - id: ac-5
   292→            given: tasks exist with status pending_review
   293→            when: kspec session start is run
   294→            then: pending_review tasks are displayed in an 'Awaiting Review' or similar section separate from
   295→              active work
   296→          - id: ac-6
   297→            given: a task with status pending_review
   298→            when: kspec tasks list --status pending_review is run
   299→            then: the task appears in the filtered list
   300→          - id: ac-7
   301→            given: the AGENTS.md task state diagram
   302→            when: describing task lifecycle
   303→            then: pending_review appears between in_progress and completed with valid transition paths
   304→          - id: ac-8
   305→            given: the CLI help content for task commands
   306→            when: viewing help for task state transitions
   307→            then: pending_review is documented with its purpose and valid transitions
   308→          - id: ac-9
   309→            given: a task with status in_progress
   310→            when: kspec task submit is run
   311→            then: the task transitions to pending_review
