   648→    title: Task Queries
   649→    type: feature
   650→    status:
   651→      maturity: draft
   652→      implementation: implemented
   653→    priority: high
   654→    tags:
   655→      - mvp
   656→      - tasks
   657→    description: |
   658→      The key task query: "what can I work on?"
   659→      `kspec tasks ready` is the primary interface for agents and humans.
   660→    acceptance_criteria:
   661→      - id: ac-query-1
   662→        given: tasks with various states and dependencies
   663→        when: kspec tasks ready runs
   664→        then: only tasks that are pending with met dependencies shown
   665→      - id: ac-query-2
   666→        given: ready tasks exist
   667→        when: kspec tasks next runs
   668→        then: highest priority ready task returned
   669→      - id: ac-query-3
   670→        given: multiple ready tasks exist with the same priority
   671→        when: kspec tasks ready runs
   672→        then: tasks are ordered by creation time ascending (oldest first within priority tier)
   673→    requirements:
